<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n9916" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀντί-δοτος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀντιδίδωμι</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>given in lieu of,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πυρός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>AP</u>
					9.165
				</span></i>
			 (<i><span class="en">
				Pall.
			</span></i>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>given as a remedy for,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κακῶν φάρμακον ἀ.</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				10.118
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> as
			Subst., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀντίδοτος</span> (sc.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δόσις</span>), ἡ, <i>an antidote, remedy,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				AP
				12.13
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Strat.
			</span></i>), <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				14.1
			</span></i>, etc.: in other places the gender is uncertain, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.42d
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				54e
			</span></i>, etc.:—hence 
				Dim.
			
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀντιδότιον</span></b> , τό, <i><span class="en">
				Archig.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Philum.
				<u>Ven.</u>
				14.7
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
